   "content": [
      {
         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><span id=\"htZoomImageMsg\"></span></p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Prerequisites</h3>This game helps you practice the Mesoamerican numerals. Before you start, we suggest reviewing the lesson <b>Overcoming limits</b>, where we learned how the indigenous peoples of Mesoamerica represented numbers using dots, bars and the sign for zero (<htcite0>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
                     "uuid": "36dcbdd0-8d4d-48ac-a1cc-57bf9c8beaa4",
                     "text": "History Tracers Team",
                     "page": "Overcoming limits",
                     "date_time": {
                        "type": "gregory",
                        "year": "2024",
                        "month": "",
                        "day": ""
                     }
                  }
               ],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_rules",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>General rules</h3>The table below shows the Mesoamerican (Maya) numerals from zero (0) to nineteen (19), arranged in five rows and four columns. In the first level, one numeral of each row is hidden; in the second level, two numerals of each row are hidden. Your goal is to click on the hidden cells to reveal the numerals. When you reveal all of them, you complete the level and can go on to the next one.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_game",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Building like a Mesoamerican</h3>Click on the hidden cells to reveal the Maya numerals. To start a new arrangement, click the button <button id=\"buildingMesoReset\" class=\"reset-tutor-btn\">🎲 New exercise</button>.</p>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center\"><span id=\"buildingMesoLevel\" class=\"level-badge\"></span></p><p><table id=\"buildingMeso\" class=\"tableTen tableTenBgBlue buildingTable\"><tr><th colspan=\"4\"><i>Maya numerals</i></th></tr></table></p><p id=\"buildingMesoCompleteMsg\" class=\"mngCongrats\" style=\"display: none; text-align: center\">🎉🎉🎉 CORRECT! 🎉🎉🎉<br />You revealed all the Maya numerals!<br />Great job!</p><p id=\"buildingMesoCongratsMsg\" class=\"mngCongrats\" style=\"display: none; text-align: center\">🎉🎉🎉 CONGRATULATIONS! 🎉🎉🎉<br />You completed all the levels!<br />Excellent work!</p><p style=\"text-align: center\"><button id=\"buildingMesoNextLevel\" class=\"game-next-btn\" style=\"display: none\"></button></p><span id=\"buildingMesoWordLevel\" style=\"display: none\">Level</span><span id=\"buildingMesoWordNextLevel\" style=\"display: none\">Next level</span><span id=\"buildingMesoWordPlayAgain\" style=\"display: none\">Play again</span>",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\">The numerals are the Mesoamerican (Maya) signs presented in <i>Overcoming limits</i> (<htcite0>).</p>",
               "source": [
